## 7. LMS dashboard
**Course cards + progress bars + lesson list + continue-learning CTA.**
```tsx
<div className="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
  {courses.map((c) => (
    <div key={c.id} className="rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
      <img src={c.cover} className="w-full aspect-video object-cover" />
      <div className="p-5 space-y-3">
        <h3 className="font-semibold">{c.title}</h3>
        <div className="h-2 rounded-full bg-slate-100"><div className="h-full rounded-full bg-indigo-500" style={{ width: `${c.progress}%` }} /></div>
        <p className="text-xs text-slate-500">{c.progress}% complete</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  ))}
</div>
```

