## 11. AI chatbot interface
**Chat thread + input + suggested prompts; sticky composer at bottom.**
```tsx
<div className="min-h-screen flex flex-col max-w-3xl mx-auto">
  <div className="flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-4 space-y-4">
    {messages.map((m) => (
      <div key={m.id} className={["max-w-[80%] rounded-2xl px-4 py-2.5 text-sm",
                                  m.role === "user" ? "ml-auto bg-indigo-600 text-white" : "bg-slate-100 text-slate-800"].join(" ")}>
        {m.content}
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>
  <div className="sticky bottom-0 bg-white border-t border-slate-200 p-4 flex gap-2">
    <input className="flex-1 px-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-300" placeholder="Ask anything…" />
    <Button>Send</Button>
  </div>
</div>
```

## 12. AI agent dashboard
