## 17. Responsive design system
**Mobile-first tokens + primitives + spacing scale + container queries.**
```ts
// tailwind.config.ts — semantic tokens
colors: { brand: "rgb(var(--brand)/<alpha-value>)", surface: "rgb(var(--surface)/<alpha-value>)", ink: "rgb(var(--ink)/<alpha-value>)" }
```

## 18. Reusable component library
**`cva` variants + `cn()` merge + barrel exports + docs page.**
```tsx
export const Button = ({ variant, size, ...rest }: Props) => (
  <button className={cn(btn({ variant, size }), className)} {...rest} />
);
```

## 19. Dark / light theme
**Class-based toggle + CSS variables + FOWT-prevention script.**
```tsx
<script dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: `try{var s=localStorage.getItem('theme');var d=s?s==='dark':matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme:dark)').matches;document.documentElement.classList.toggle('dark',d)}catch(e){}` }} />
```

## 20. Accessibility
**Semantic HTML, focus rings, ARIA states, keyboard-first, reduced-motion.**
```tsx
<button aria-pressed={on} className="focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand motion-reduce:transition-none">Toggle</button>
```

## 21. Performance optimization
**Server Components by default, `next/image`, `next/font`, streaming + Suspense, ISR.**
```tsx
<Suspense fallback={<Skeleton />}>{/* slow section */}</Suspense>
```

## 22. Production deployment
**Vercel/Netlify + env vars + analytics + preview deploys + edge caching.**
```bash
vercel --prod
```

