| Project | Primary Tailwind concepts |
|---|---|
| Portfolio | Layout, typography, responsive grid |
| Blog | Typography (`prose`), routing |
| Login / Register | Forms, focus/error states, cards |
| Pricing | Grid, highlight scales, dark mode |
| Admin | Sticky sidebar, z-index, tables |
| LMS | Cards, progress bars, aspect ratios |
| E-commerce | Product cards, filters, cart drawer |
| CRM | Kanban flex, drag-friendly columns |
| Analytics | Charts, stats, tabs |
| Chatbot | Sticky composer, scroll containers |
| Agent dashboard | Timelines, logs, badges |
| Doc analyzer | Dropzone, progress meters |
| AI SaaS | Full app shell + route groups |
| Dev portal | 3-column docs layout |
| Production site | Metadata, sitemap, route groups |
| Design system | Tokens, variants, container queries |
| Component library | `cva`, `cn`, barrel exports |
| Dark mode | CSS vars, class toggle |
| A11y | ARIA variants, focus-visible, reduced-motion |
| Performance | RSC, images, fonts, streaming |
| Deployment | Env, previews, caching |

